# Input
```css
/* should not generate diagnostics */
@keyframes fade-in {
  from {
    opacity: 0;
  }
  @at-root (without: all) {
    .fade-in {
      animation: fade-in 200ms ease !important;
    }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      .fade-in {
        animation: none !important;
      }
    }
  }
  to {
    opacity: 1;
  }
}

```
